### Step 1 - Read the seeded development customer
# Requires: step 0 and the local environment.
# Produces: the customer prerequisite used by the cart flow.

GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}

### Read the additional customers used by failure flows
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{outOfStockCustomerId}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{paymentExpiryCustomerId}}
